NAME
    selftest - Run one complete Inu runtime and userland execution conformance pass.

SYNOPSIS
    selftest

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Equivalent to stress all 1. The controller itself executes in ring 3 and uses only
    Inu Get/Set/Event operations: Event(ConsoleOutput) for live progress,
    Set(StressControl) to request each managed stage, and Get(StressStatus) to wait for
    its result. Event output is queued to the GUI worker and managed stages run on the
    persistent Background worker, keeping heavy work off the syscall stack. The test also
    validates Inu package parsing, executable loading, private process paging, ring-3
    IRETQ entry, protected SYSCALL/SYSRETQ, current-process identity, controlled exit to
    ring 0 and cleanup.

SEE ALSO
    stress
